      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks to me that that this is a kernel bug. The driver should call cros_ec_get_next_event() at or near probe time. We do already call this function in cros_ec_report_events_during_suspend(), to be sure the EC is not stuck when it sends MKBP events while the AP is suspended.\n\nLet me work on a kernel patch. We could even simplify this code, and assume the host always pump out the MKBP events.",
