      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought we always wanted to do this otherwise we won\u0027t try to set to ACTIVE again, right? (and we won\u0027t try 3 times - unless someone else calls activate for us -- but we shouldn\u0027t rely on that)",
      "range": {
